 243: expand which tasks may be delegated, except that the Adversarial review gate
 244: above is mandatory. This policy supersedes older model and effort
 245: recommendations in saved memories or historical task notes.
 246: 
 247: Delegation mechanics depend on which model family is orchestrating, because each
