 110: | FR-023 | Mentions render distinctly for everyone in the feed; a message that mentions the viewing user is 
highlighted for that user. | Must | AC-027 |
 111: | FR-024 | The client records metric events — send latency (press → server confirmed), time spent in the outbox, 
